      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i noticed you mentioned fair skin as the typical case, but i was reading that it can look pretty different in patients with darker skin tones or different ethnicities. how does the presentation change for someone with a much higher melanin content? like, what are the specific clinical signs i should be looking for if they don't fit that \"standard\" fair-skinned profile?",
